WEBVTT

00:00:14.490 --> 00:00:16.490
Akane!

00:00:18.160 --> 00:00:19.580
You caught the culprit, right?

00:00:21.290 --> 00:00:22.370
What's wrong?

00:00:26.460 --> 00:00:27.670
You...

00:00:29.800 --> 00:00:32.010
K-Kuroki?

00:00:32.010 --> 00:00:34.470
But... It can't be...

00:00:34.470 --> 00:00:35.300
No way...

00:00:37.560 --> 00:00:38.720
Rei...

00:00:41.350 --> 00:00:43.560
I see what's going on now.

00:00:43.940 --> 00:00:46.440
You four were just pretending to be nice to me!

00:00:48.980 --> 00:00:50.070
Liars!

00:01:00.950 --> 00:01:04.540
I wasn’t lying...

00:03:00.410 --> 00:03:02.960
Who would've imagined it was her?

00:03:05.380 --> 00:03:08.210
Do you have the results of the physical examinations?

00:03:08.210 --> 00:03:10.090
Yes. Here's the data.

00:03:12.550 --> 00:03:13.680
Just as I thought.

00:03:14.590 --> 00:03:18.600
She's human, but at the same time, she's something different.

00:03:20.060 --> 00:03:23.100
That key, her only possession isn't ordinary either.

00:03:23.600 --> 00:03:27.860
When we analyzed its molecular structure, we found discrepancies in the quantum phases.

00:03:28.690 --> 00:03:31.440
It's an anomaly that shouldn't exist in this world.

00:03:34.570 --> 00:03:37.450
Does that mean she's...

00:03:43.290 --> 00:03:44.370
Please!

00:03:44.750 --> 00:03:47.920
Ms. Mizuha, let us talk with Rei!

00:03:48.250 --> 00:03:50.880
There must be a misunderstanding!

00:03:50.880 --> 00:03:53.760
Kuroki couldn't have been controlling the Alones!

00:03:53.760 --> 00:03:55.930
Investigate it thoroughly once more!

00:03:56.930 --> 00:03:59.560
You witnessed it yourselves, didn't you?

00:03:59.560 --> 00:04:00.810
It's a fact.

00:04:02.140 --> 00:04:05.190
Until the interrogation ends, no one is allowed to see her.

00:04:06.940 --> 00:04:10.280
May we see her once it's over then?

00:04:10.900 --> 00:04:12.610
I can't make any promises.

00:04:12.610 --> 00:04:13.700
Why not?

00:04:14.360 --> 00:04:18.080
She used the Alones to try to destroy the Manifestor Engine.

00:04:18.910 --> 00:04:23.870
At the moment, Kuroki Rei is the greatest source of danger for our world.

00:04:24.880 --> 00:04:25.750
But still!

00:04:25.750 --> 00:04:30.920
She will be punished accordingly, even if she's a child.

00:04:30.920 --> 00:04:32.380
No way...

00:04:32.380 --> 00:04:38.810
Additionally, all of her personal information was forged.

00:04:39.770 --> 00:04:41.310
Does that mean?

00:04:41.310 --> 00:04:42.310
You heard me right.

00:04:42.940 --> 00:04:48.570
There is no data in this world that could prove that she's Kuroki Rei.

00:04:53.110 --> 00:04:57.080
All these facts point to one conclusion.

00:04:57.830 --> 00:05:04.830
We can safely say that the girl calling herself Kuroki Rei is from another world.

00:05:05.170 --> 00:05:06.750
Another world?

00:05:06.750 --> 00:05:08.050
Impossible!

00:05:08.050 --> 00:05:09.840
There's nothing surprising about it.

00:05:10.380 --> 00:05:17.140
Since the age of Einstein, the existence of parallel worlds has been widely discussed.

00:05:18.430 --> 00:05:24.980
The real issue, however, is <i>why</i> she's come to our world.

00:05:26.480 --> 00:05:29.280
<i>It's not over yet!</i>

00:05:36.830 --> 00:05:38.240
Excuse us...

00:05:41.040 --> 00:05:42.960
What a depressing room...

00:05:42.960 --> 00:05:44.120
It's empty.

00:05:44.830 --> 00:05:48.300
Did Kuroki live here all alone?

00:05:53.470 --> 00:05:58.350
I wonder how she felt when she looked at the Manifestor Engine...

00:06:00.100 --> 00:06:06.900
I ran into her by chance while you were hospitalized.

00:06:07.860 --> 00:06:12.700
She said she had an important task to do.

00:06:13.450 --> 00:06:16.450
Using the Alones to destroy the Manifestor Engine?

00:06:16.450 --> 00:06:17.370
No!

00:06:17.910 --> 00:06:20.080
Well, that might be it...

00:06:20.660 --> 00:06:26.040
But I think she has a reason for why she did all this.

00:06:26.880 --> 00:06:30.590
I want to talk to her about it properly...

00:06:33.380 --> 00:06:36.800
Why does she hate the Manifestor Engine?

00:06:37.970 --> 00:06:43.100
She must know that without the Engine, the world would be a mess...

00:06:43.730 --> 00:06:45.110
Himawari...

00:06:45.770 --> 00:06:51.150
I love the Engine, but is it making someone else unhappy?

00:06:52.200 --> 00:06:53.910
I don't want that!

00:06:54.030 --> 00:06:59.080
She also said there's something she needs to get back, no matter the cost.

00:06:59.580 --> 00:07:03.620
I wonder what she's trying to get back...

00:07:04.540 --> 00:07:11.420
I've been with her longer than any of you, yet I never noticed anything...

00:07:12.470 --> 00:07:15.760
Do you think it's your responsibility since you're the class rep?

00:07:16.840 --> 00:07:18.810
I-I just...

00:07:18.810 --> 00:07:19.930
So stubborn.

00:07:21.520 --> 00:07:23.850
She called us liars...

00:07:27.400 --> 00:07:31.650
She thinks we lied to her.

00:07:32.610 --> 00:07:34.530
I don't want that!

00:07:34.530 --> 00:07:36.740
Me neither!

00:07:37.200 --> 00:07:40.910
I really wanted to become friends with her!

00:07:44.000 --> 00:07:47.880
Is Rei really on the Alones' side?

00:07:56.930 --> 00:08:04.530
So you're suggesting that that girl calling herself Kuroki Rei came from another world?

00:08:05.190 --> 00:08:06.020
Exactly.

00:08:07.230 --> 00:08:08.150
What a joke.

00:08:08.780 --> 00:08:10.780
Think about it for a moment.

00:08:10.780 --> 00:08:14.780
Why couldn't we detect the Alones until they were close to the Manifestor Engine?

00:08:15.120 --> 00:08:20.040
Instead of approaching the Engine, they emerge there instead!

00:08:20.410 --> 00:08:26.040
They are proof of a world with a different topology we cannot detect.

00:08:26.500 --> 00:08:30.420
Furthermore, that would explain why she displayed extraordinary physical abilities

00:08:30.420 --> 00:08:33.380
even though her body isn't any different from that of a human.

00:08:33.970 --> 00:08:37.220
If we presume that the physical laws underlying the molecular construction of her tissues

00:08:37.220 --> 00:08:42.480
are governed by different constants, every piece falls into its place.

00:08:43.020 --> 00:08:50.440
After rechecking her examination data using the filters Dr. Isshiki created,

00:08:50.570 --> 00:08:58.780
we discovered a relationship between the particle waves she emitted and the emergence of Alones.

00:08:58.790 --> 00:09:03.460
Kuroki Rei is like a living lighthouse that leads the Alones to this world.

00:09:04.000 --> 00:09:07.130
Thus, she fulfills the role of a beacon, among others.

00:09:07.590 --> 00:09:14.680
What?! Doesn't that mean that as long as she exists, the Alones will keep attacking us?

00:09:14.680 --> 00:09:16.390
Yes, if you want to put it bluntly.

00:09:16.720 --> 00:09:18.220
How can you say that so nonchalantly?

00:09:18.600 --> 00:09:21.520
We must dispose of her as soon as possible!

00:09:22.390 --> 00:09:22.770
Exactly!

00:09:22.770 --> 00:09:25.520
That's right! She's a danger to us all!

00:09:38.790 --> 00:09:39.540
Hey...

00:09:40.370 --> 00:09:45.040
What if Kuroki was really controlling the Alones?

00:09:45.630 --> 00:09:47.790
What would you do then, Akane?

00:09:49.710 --> 00:09:50.760
Dunno...

00:09:51.760 --> 00:09:55.300
But I don't want it to end like this.

00:09:56.220 --> 00:09:58.260
What about you, Wakaba?

00:09:58.260 --> 00:09:59.390
I...

00:09:59.970 --> 00:10:01.980
We're all the same.

00:10:01.980 --> 00:10:04.060
None of us have an answer.

00:10:05.900 --> 00:10:07.570
Can we still see her?

00:10:08.520 --> 00:10:11.650
Will we never see her again?

00:10:11.650 --> 00:10:13.450
I don't want that!

00:10:13.450 --> 00:10:14.570
Akane...

00:10:15.740 --> 00:10:18.990
I want to talk with her once more...

00:10:18.990 --> 00:10:23.080
Talk with her a lot and get to know her...

00:10:23.750 --> 00:10:29.840
I want her to know all of you better too.

00:10:31.130 --> 00:10:34.470
I want to see her again!

00:10:35.180 --> 00:10:36.350
Me too!

00:10:36.760 --> 00:10:37.970
Same here!

00:10:37.970 --> 00:10:39.010
No objection.

00:10:39.470 --> 00:10:40.310
Let's go!

00:10:43.850 --> 00:10:45.100
Ignition!

00:11:10.380 --> 00:11:13.090
<i>Wait for us, Rei!</i>

00:11:14.220 --> 00:11:18.560
Isshiki Akane and Futaba Aoi's Pallet Suits are online.

00:11:19.010 --> 00:11:22.940
Saegusa Wakaba and Shinomiya Himawari have equipped their Pallet Suits as well.

00:11:23.270 --> 00:11:26.190
They're on their way toward the UDF HQ.

00:11:29.190 --> 00:11:30.490
Lt. Amagi?

00:11:30.490 --> 00:11:34.530
I am deeply sorry, could you overlook this for now?

00:11:41.080 --> 00:11:43.250
<i>Getting fired would be the least of my worries here...</i>

00:11:54.380 --> 00:11:56.720
There! She's there!

00:12:06.360 --> 00:12:07.360
Stop!

00:12:08.650 --> 00:12:11.150
Emergency alert! Intruders at the HQ!

00:12:11.570 --> 00:12:12.900
Warning! Intruders—

00:12:12.900 --> 00:12:14.660
Naked Collider!

00:12:34.010 --> 00:12:35.340
I'll pay for the repairs!

00:12:36.010 --> 00:12:37.140
This way!

00:12:42.230 --> 00:12:43.140
What?

00:12:43.730 --> 00:12:45.150
The girls?!

00:12:45.150 --> 00:12:47.150
They're finally here.

00:12:48.020 --> 00:12:50.190
Took them longer than I expected.

00:12:50.990 --> 00:12:53.740
Don't tell me you've expected this from the beginning...

00:12:53.740 --> 00:12:55.160
But of course!

00:12:55.410 --> 00:12:57.160
She's my granddaughter after all!

00:13:05.080 --> 00:13:06.750
Akane, go on ahead!

00:13:07.460 --> 00:13:08.670
Aoi!

00:13:08.670 --> 00:13:10.590
Hurry to Kuroki!

00:13:11.340 --> 00:13:13.970
Tell her we're not liars.

00:13:15.720 --> 00:13:16.970
Girls...

00:13:17.510 --> 00:13:20.470
Shouldn't we say we want be her friends, rather than that?

00:13:21.730 --> 00:13:22.980
What?

00:13:23.520 --> 00:13:24.770
Nothing!

00:13:24.770 --> 00:13:25.940
What?

00:13:27.440 --> 00:13:28.480
Okay!

00:13:28.980 --> 00:13:30.990
I'm counting on you all!

00:13:37.620 --> 00:13:39.120
You shall not pass!

00:13:44.580 --> 00:13:51.260
Rei!

00:13:59.310 --> 00:14:01.480
Don't get in my way!

00:14:09.030 --> 00:14:09.820
Rei!

00:14:10.280 --> 00:14:11.990
Isshiki Akane?

00:14:12.650 --> 00:14:14.950
Wait, I'll get you outta there right away!

00:14:18.990 --> 00:14:20.330
Why did you come here?

00:14:21.620 --> 00:14:23.710
Are you here just to laugh at me?

00:14:23.710 --> 00:14:24.750
That's not it!

00:14:25.000 --> 00:14:28.130
I want to talk with you!

00:14:31.720 --> 00:14:33.630
There's nothing for us to talk about.

00:14:34.380 --> 00:14:38.000
Maybe not for you. But there is for me!

00:14:43.190 --> 00:14:44.980
It's not just me, either.

00:14:45.270 --> 00:14:48.650
Aoi, Wakaba, and Himawari too.

00:14:49.570 --> 00:14:50.990
They're all here.

00:14:51.820 --> 00:14:53.990
We didn't lie to you...

00:14:54.820 --> 00:14:57.700
We really want to become friends with you!

00:14:58.660 --> 00:15:00.830
Words are meaningless!

00:15:02.710 --> 00:15:07.000
But words are the only way for us to tell you!

00:15:14.680 --> 00:15:20.020
I want to get along with you better.

00:15:24.310 --> 00:15:27.400
From the moment we met...

00:15:28.150 --> 00:15:30.230
I felt that vividly!

00:15:34.530 --> 00:15:37.620
Why? Why can you still say that?

00:15:39.870 --> 00:15:42.620
You don't know anything about me!

00:15:43.370 --> 00:15:44.870
That's why I want to know!

00:15:48.750 --> 00:15:51.260
I'll tell you everything about me!

00:15:51.840 --> 00:15:56.220
So tell me more about yourself too!

00:16:10.360 --> 00:16:12.360
Why?

00:16:12.360 --> 00:16:14.780
Why would you go this far?

00:16:17.240 --> 00:16:20.120
Because we're friends...

00:16:30.340 --> 00:16:35.050
Jeez. Even if you're my granddaughter, you should show at least <i>some</i> restraint.

00:16:35.470 --> 00:16:37.970
Granddad, why are you here?

00:16:39.430 --> 00:16:41.520
Akane! Kuroki!

00:16:42.180 --> 00:16:43.270
Girls!

00:16:44.020 --> 00:16:45.520
Are you two okay?

00:16:45.980 --> 00:16:48.610
Yeah, it's nothing.

00:16:48.610 --> 00:16:49.440
Look!

00:16:53.360 --> 00:16:55.410
Good job, Akane!

00:16:55.410 --> 00:16:59.700
You took all the good parts for yourself.

00:17:01.540 --> 00:17:02.540
Sorry...

00:17:05.920 --> 00:17:07.090
Listen, girl.

00:17:08.210 --> 00:17:13.930
Seven years ago, I got a message from an intelligence that far exceeds humankind.

00:17:17.390 --> 00:17:25.850
That existence is what's sending the Alones and trying to make you destroy the Manifestor Engine.

00:17:26.190 --> 00:17:27.400
Am I wrong?

00:17:30.730 --> 00:17:33.360
<i>Let me answer that.</i>

00:17:33.360 --> 00:17:34.490
What?

00:17:34.490 --> 00:17:35.240
The crow talked!

00:17:35.240 --> 00:17:35.700
No way.

00:17:35.700 --> 00:17:36.490
A monster?

00:17:36.490 --> 00:17:37.120
What?

00:17:37.950 --> 00:17:38.990
Is this a trick?

00:17:39.370 --> 00:17:40.870
Why are you here?

00:17:40.870 --> 00:17:42.370
Who are you?

00:17:43.080 --> 00:17:45.500
<i>I am their mediator.</i>

00:17:45.500 --> 00:17:48.340
<i>They, who exist in the loophole of the beginning and the end.</i>

00:17:48.340 --> 00:17:50.960
<i>They, who embrace the whole of spacetime.</i>

00:17:50.960 --> 00:17:54.050
<i>They, who are truly absolute.</i>

00:17:56.050 --> 00:17:58.970
Truly absolute, eh? Pretty big words.

00:17:58.970 --> 00:18:02.270
Why would creatures of that level fear the Manifestor Engine?

00:18:02.680 --> 00:18:10.530
<i>They are worried about lowly creatures foolishly playing with powers well beyond their control.</i>

00:18:10.530 --> 00:18:14.530
<i>It disrupts the order of this universe.</i>

00:18:15.610 --> 00:18:20.040
The world I came from was destroyed by the Manifestor Energy running out of control.

00:18:21.450 --> 00:18:26.040
This crow appeared before me, the sole survivor, and told me

00:18:26.630 --> 00:18:30.550
if I did what it said, they would return my world to how it was.

00:18:31.510 --> 00:18:32.590
So...

00:18:33.720 --> 00:18:34.680
Rei...

00:18:34.680 --> 00:18:36.050
So that was it?

00:18:36.050 --> 00:18:39.260
When you said you want to get something back...

00:18:39.260 --> 00:18:42.810
You meant that different world where you came from?

00:18:43.230 --> 00:18:47.690
<i>Kuroki Rei, I am truly, deeply disappointed in you.</i>

00:18:47.690 --> 00:18:49.780
<i>You could not fulfill such a simple task.</i>

00:18:51.820 --> 00:18:53.990
<i>All of you have let me down.</i>

00:18:53.990 --> 00:18:57.410
<i>You seriously want to keep Rei alive?</i>

00:18:58.660 --> 00:19:03.210
<i>Kuroki Rei is the beacon that leads the Alones to this spacetime.</i>

00:19:03.660 --> 00:19:06.750
<i>You should have just killed her if you wanted to end it.</i>

00:19:07.710 --> 00:19:10.460
<i>And yet, you...</i>

00:19:10.800 --> 00:19:12.470
How can you say that so nonchalantly?

00:19:12.470 --> 00:19:15.720
We must dispose of her as soon as possible!

00:19:15.720 --> 00:19:17.680
Dispose of her?

00:19:17.680 --> 00:19:21.020
Is there no sense of friendship in your hearts?

00:19:21.020 --> 00:19:25.190
Friendship? What on earth are you even talking about?

00:19:25.190 --> 00:19:26.230
Dr. Isshiki...

00:19:26.520 --> 00:19:31.400
We just need to find a way to prevent the Alones from tracing her!

00:19:32.030 --> 00:19:34.160
Is that possible?

00:19:34.160 --> 00:19:36.950
No problem for the great Isshiki Kenjirou!

00:19:36.950 --> 00:19:40.490
Either way, I won't let you "dispose of" Kuroki Rei!

00:19:41.700 --> 00:19:44.040
<i>I listened to it all.</i>

00:19:45.630 --> 00:19:47.040
Eavesdropping, huh?

00:19:47.040 --> 00:19:48.170
Gramps...

00:19:48.590 --> 00:19:51.970
Humans, you know,

00:19:51.970 --> 00:19:55.180
can't live without water, air, light, and friendship.

00:19:55.180 --> 00:19:57.930
If you look down on friendship, you look down on life,

00:19:57.930 --> 00:20:00.810
and lose your right to live.

00:20:00.810 --> 00:20:05.350
You proved that yourselves in your battles.

00:20:05.940 --> 00:20:07.820
Gramps...

00:20:07.820 --> 00:20:10.190
<i>You could have avoided this.</i>

00:20:10.650 --> 00:20:13.200
<i>If you killed Rei, it would have been all over.</i>

00:20:13.860 --> 00:20:19.830
<i>This girl controlling the Alones was the greatest trap in this test.</i>

00:20:19.830 --> 00:20:24.710
<i>The moment you killed Kuroki Rei, this world would have failed.</i>

00:20:25.630 --> 00:20:28.460
<i>This result is most unexpected.</i>

00:20:29.800 --> 00:20:34.130
Does that mean we passed then? This test of yours.

00:20:34.130 --> 00:20:35.130
<i>No.</i>

00:20:35.130 --> 00:20:35.140
What?
<i>No.</i>

00:20:35.140 --> 00:20:35.720
What?

00:20:36.300 --> 00:20:40.180
<i>I have destroyed countless worlds until now.</i>

00:20:40.180 --> 00:20:48.730
<i>I understood that they, just like you, with your low grade intelligence, do not truly want the Manifestor Energy.</i>

00:20:49.360 --> 00:20:52.240
<i>No one must pass the test.</i>

00:20:52.240 --> 00:20:58.490
What are you saying?! What's the point in the test if unconditional destruction is the outcome either way?

00:20:58.830 --> 00:21:00.830
Yeah! It's weird!

00:21:01.120 --> 00:21:03.410
That's not fair at all!

00:21:03.410 --> 00:21:04.920
You've got no right to scold us!

00:21:04.920 --> 00:21:06.330
Get lost, birdbrain!

00:21:06.630 --> 00:21:09.750
<i>I am just and neutral by nature.</i>

00:21:09.750 --> 00:21:14.220
<i>That is why I must correct such a mistaken result.</i>

00:21:14.510 --> 00:21:17.220
This is completely insane!

00:21:17.470 --> 00:21:21.850
<i>Rei, it is all your fault that it came down to this.</i>

00:21:21.850 --> 00:21:25.350
<i>You failed. I shall take your bow.</i>

00:21:27.940 --> 00:21:30.360
Don't you dare touch my friend!

00:21:30.860 --> 00:21:31.820
<i>You are a nuisance.</i>

00:21:42.330 --> 00:21:43.330
Girls!

00:21:44.830 --> 00:21:46.460
<i>Now, give it to me!</i>

00:21:47.000 --> 00:21:50.840
No! If you take this, my world will never return!

00:21:50.840 --> 00:21:53.260
<i>It should not return.</i>

00:21:53.260 --> 00:21:56.590
<i>I am sure they never desired such an outcome.</i>

00:21:57.050 --> 00:22:01.220
<i>My duty is to realize the future they desired.</i>

00:22:01.220 --> 00:22:05.100
<i>And now, in their place, I shall fulfill that desire!</i>

00:22:05.810 --> 00:22:07.360
But...

00:22:11.150 --> 00:22:12.240
Rei!

00:22:12.240 --> 00:22:13.070
Kuroki!
Rei!

00:22:13.070 --> 00:22:13.360
Rei!

00:22:13.360 --> 00:22:15.820
No!

00:22:21.830 --> 00:22:23.580
Oh no! Retreat!

00:24:13.680 --> 00:24:17.000
Aoi-chan, Wakaba-chan, Himawari-chan...

00:24:17.000 --> 00:24:19.000
and Rei-chan!

00:24:19.260 --> 00:24:20.200
Thank you!

00:24:20.200 --> 00:24:20.210
I love you all!
Thank you!

00:24:20.210 --> 00:24:22.000
I love you all!

